# Project Basics

This is a TypeScript project (gp-admin). Always ensure files are created in the correct project directory. Double-check file paths before writing.

## Workflow Rules

After generating or editing code, always run the build/lint check (`npm run build` or equivalent) before presenting the result as complete. Fix any type errors, import issues, or lint failures before moving on.

## Code Quality Standards

Prefer reusable, senior-level patterns: generic wrappers, singletons, shared utilities. Avoid one-off implementations or prop drilling. If building a server action or SDK integration, make it generic and reusable from the start.

## General Rules

Avoid obvious comments that just explains what the code does
